    "Values a wiring type does not provide read 0.",
    "Corrected from the manual's table: export reactive energy is at 78 (0x4E; the table prints 0x4A) and the line-to-line voltages at 200-206 are in V (the table prints W).",
    "Names and descriptions are translated from the Polish manual."
